WEBVTT

00:01.730 --> 00:03.690
Finally, the day has come.

00:03.690 --> 00:04.770
Yeah.

00:04.770 --> 00:07.770
I am really glad that I met you.

00:07.770 --> 00:10.360
I am fired up about a football match

00:10.360 --> 00:12.110
for the first time in my life.

00:12.110 --> 00:15.240
Let's make it a good match then, Ishizaki.

00:15.240 --> 00:17.120
Everyone, I am counting on you today.

00:17.120 --> 00:18.120
Me too.

00:18.120 --> 00:18.660
Yeah!

00:18.660 --> 00:19.580
Me too.

00:19.580 --> 00:21.750
Let's not just have a good match, let's win!

00:21.750 --> 00:22.330
Yup!

00:22.330 --> 00:24.790
Alright, let's go everybody.

00:24.790 --> 00:26.290
Yeah.

00:26.290 --> 00:28.000
Listen to me, guys!

00:28.000 --> 00:30.880
Whatever happens, just don't let Oozora Tsubasa

00:30.880 --> 00:34.430
score a goal in this match.

00:34.430 --> 00:36.090
After all, this match is a contest between us

00:36.090 --> 00:39.510
to see if he can score a goal against me.

00:40.850 --> 00:41.850
Ishizaki...

00:41.850 --> 00:43.810
Wait, you're the forward?

00:43.810 --> 00:44.850
You could say that.

00:44.850 --> 00:46.480
Isn't it that Oozora guy?

00:46.480 --> 00:48.940
If it's Tsubasa you want, he's over there.

00:49.610 --> 00:50.820
What?

00:50.820 --> 00:53.110
Tsubasa is in the center-back?

00:54.490 --> 00:55.530
Let's go!

00:55.530 --> 00:56.780
Yeah!

00:56.780 --> 01:00.830
With Izawa's signal, Shuutetsu's switch has turned on.

01:00.830 --> 01:02.080
Damn this guy!

01:02.080 --> 01:04.620
This is the tactic Shuutetsu is known for!

01:04.620 --> 01:07.210
Forward Kisugi is attacking.

01:08.210 --> 01:10.460
Will Shuutetsu have the first goal?

01:11.880 --> 01:12.880
It's cut!

01:12.880 --> 01:15.800
Nankatsu has just cut through that shot!

01:15.800 --> 01:17.680
You bastard!

01:17.680 --> 01:19.430
A superb feint!

01:19.430 --> 01:22.520
Shuutetsu can't even touch the ball.

01:22.520 --> 01:24.390
Hey, Tsubasa!

01:25.230 --> 01:27.270
Ishizaki!

01:27.270 --> 01:30.110
Tsubasa, why aren't you coming up here...?

01:30.520 --> 01:32.820
I thought this was supposed to a contest between us...

01:32.820 --> 01:33.900
All right, I've got it!

01:33.900 --> 01:36.150
Why are you passing the ball to Ishizaki?

01:36.150 --> 01:39.320
Eat this, Wakabayashi!

01:41.080 --> 01:43.490
Why are you not attacking me, Tsubasa?

01:46.210 --> 01:47.210
You guys!

01:47.210 --> 01:48.870
Our enemy is Tsubasa alone.

01:48.870 --> 01:50.330
Hurry up and start scoring!

01:50.330 --> 01:52.800
Our goal is to score 50 in this match!

01:55.090 --> 01:57.510
Tsubasa... Come and attack me.

01:57.970 --> 02:02.970
Wakabayashi, this too is a contest between us.

02:16.030 --> 02:21.660
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

02:16.030 --> 02:21.660
<i>koronde toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

02:21.660 --> 02:26.790
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

02:21.660 --> 02:27.290
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

02:27.290 --> 02:32.920
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

02:27.330 --> 02:32.920
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidÃ´ ga</i>

02:32.920 --> 02:40.840
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:32.920 --> 02:40.840
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:40.840 --> 02:46.600
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:40.840 --> 02:46.600
<i>goal o soreta kibÃ´ ga atte mo</i>

02:46.600 --> 02:55.110
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:46.600 --> 02:55.110
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:55.270 --> 03:00.910
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:55.270 --> 03:00.910
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

03:00.910 --> 03:06.830
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

03:00.910 --> 03:06.830
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

03:06.830 --> 03:08.450
<i>Run & Run!</i>

03:08.450 --> 03:15.710
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

03:08.450 --> 03:15.710
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

03:15.710 --> 03:18.670
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Go, our kicks!</i>

03:15.710 --> 03:18.670
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kick o</i>

03:18.670 --> 03:23.590
<i>Leap out into a huge TV</i>

03:18.670 --> 03:23.590
<i>tobidasÃ´ dodekai TV</i>

03:35.690 --> 03:41.740
It's time for the final match of the contest between the Shuutetsu and Nankatsu Elementary Schools!

03:42.070 --> 03:45.320
They have faced each other in 26 competitions thus far, and are still at a draw.

03:45.700 --> 03:49.330
The deciding contest will be this football match.

03:49.330 --> 03:52.960
<i>Fight! Fight! Tsubasa!</i>

03:53.420 --> 03:55.790
With the first half still scoreless, Shuutetsu's captain

03:55.790 --> 04:01.050
Wakabayashi has declared a 50-goal lead in this match!

04:01.380 --> 04:04.260
Shuutetsu's pressing the attack to make that a reality!

04:07.260 --> 04:08.060
Taki!

04:10.680 --> 04:12.060
All right, let's go!

04:12.060 --> 04:13.560
It's just Nankatsu,

04:13.560 --> 04:14.900
50 goals are just

04:15.690 --> 04:17.400
too easy!

04:17.400 --> 04:18.650
Damn it!

04:20.530 --> 04:22.280
Taki sends the ball in again.

04:23.700 --> 04:25.570
All right, here comes the first goal!

04:27.120 --> 04:28.580
I can see the goal!

04:29.450 --> 04:31.000
Shuutetsu's Izawa

04:31.000 --> 04:33.580
aims for the goal with a mid-range shot!

04:33.580 --> 04:35.170
The keeper is jumping desperately,

04:35.170 --> 04:36.540
but he won't be able to reach...!

04:37.040 --> 04:37.710
Yes!

04:39.420 --> 04:41.710
Whoa! He stopped it!

04:41.710 --> 04:43.340
He stopped it again!

04:45.090 --> 04:47.350
Shuutetsu Elementary, reigning national champions,

04:47.350 --> 04:49.810
a team with immense pride in their offense,

04:49.810 --> 04:51.390
is held scoreless!

04:53.230 --> 04:54.310
And their opponent is a team

04:54.310 --> 04:58.310
that they previously beat 30-0 in a practice match!

04:58.310 --> 04:59.900
The champions are being toyed with

04:59.900 --> 05:03.190
by a single person!

05:04.070 --> 05:05.070
Eat this!

05:05.650 --> 05:08.240
A fantasista has appeared on this field,

05:09.280 --> 05:10.240
and his name is,

05:12.450 --> 05:15.370
Oozora Tsubasa, Nankatsu's #10!

05:15.370 --> 05:18.000
And this time, he's protected the goal with an overhead kick!

05:18.000 --> 05:19.420
Tsubasa!

05:19.420 --> 05:20.540
All right!

05:20.540 --> 05:24.050
Well done, Tsubasa!

05:24.050 --> 05:26.880
Shuutetsu can't score a goal!

05:27.890 --> 05:30.180
So, he's Tsubasa.

05:30.180 --> 05:31.560
He's a pretty good center-back!

05:32.850 --> 05:35.810
He's not really a center-back, is he...

05:36.270 --> 05:39.440
The precision of kis kicks, his ability to read the course of the ball,

05:39.900 --> 05:41.610
and his sense for the game.

05:42.860 --> 05:44.940
Is he, possibly...

05:44.940 --> 05:47.530
All right everyone, work a little harder.

05:47.530 --> 05:49.280
Don't just leave everything to Tsubasa.

05:49.160 --> 05:49.870
Yeah.

05:50.990 --> 05:52.160
Here, Taki!

05:54.950 --> 05:56.080
Let's get the first goal!

05:56.460 --> 05:59.130
Nankatsu is all about that #10, anyway.

05:59.130 --> 06:01.460
Just attack until we break through!

06:01.460 --> 06:02.210
Yeah!

06:02.210 --> 06:04.210
You think we're just gonna let you do that?

06:04.210 --> 06:06.970
Shuutetsu attacks!

06:15.560 --> 06:16.390
Move!

06:17.980 --> 06:18.890
I won't let you!

06:20.520 --> 06:21.690
These guys...!

06:22.520 --> 06:26.650
We got through them easily the last time.

06:29.490 --> 06:32.280
We can't let ourselves go down that easily!

06:32.620 --> 06:35.660
We trained hard with Coach Roberto!

06:38.710 --> 06:39.540
Ah, crap!

06:39.540 --> 06:41.330
Nankatsu's Nakazato...

06:41.330 --> 06:42.920
He clears the ball!

06:42.920 --> 06:45.090
Nankatsu escapes a pinch again!

06:45.590 --> 06:48.920
10 minutes have passed in this 20-minute half,

06:48.920 --> 06:51.090
and the match is still scoreless!

06:53.890 --> 06:56.770
What the hell are you guys doing?!

06:57.600 --> 06:59.850
All right, it's going just as planned.

07:00.270 --> 07:03.900
We'll let Tsubasa play defense to keep them scoreless in the first half,

07:03.900 --> 07:05.860
and then we'll make our move in the second half.

07:07.320 --> 07:07.940
Kisugi!

07:08.360 --> 07:10.200
Shuutetsu's lead scorer Kisugi

07:10.200 --> 07:12.740
leads the attack with his well-known dribbling!

07:12.740 --> 07:15.950
Its embarassing that I,

07:15.950 --> 07:18.660
Shuutetsu's scorer, have yet to score!

07:20.750 --> 07:24.920
Again, a thunderous sliding tackle stops him short!

07:24.920 --> 07:27.590
Thanks to huge efforts of Nankatsu's Tsubasa,

07:27.590 --> 07:29.800
Shuutetsu is still scoreless!

07:29.800 --> 07:32.090
It's not just because of #10 that

07:32.090 --> 07:34.470
Shuutetsu hasn't scored a goal yet...

07:34.970 --> 07:37.310
All right everyone, you can go a little forward.

07:37.310 --> 07:40.810
Okay. Guys, let's move further up past the line.

07:40.810 --> 07:42.480
Because of that #10,

07:42.480 --> 07:45.730
the others are playing fearlessly.

07:47.780 --> 07:52.070
Nankatsu's coach, by playing his best player at center-back,

07:52.070 --> 07:56.740
has completely settled the team's balance.

07:57.330 --> 08:00.040
It's not just because of Tsubasa that we haven't scored yet.

08:00.040 --> 08:04.790
The team's play is really shining in ways that are underappreciated.

08:04.790 --> 08:06.250
With these scarce few weeks,

08:06.250 --> 08:08.880
how did these weaklings get this good?

08:08.880 --> 08:11.010
Hey, get more physical!

08:11.010 --> 08:14.590
Right there, Tsubasa. Do your best!

08:14.590 --> 08:16.850
How's the little footballer's condition?

08:20.100 --> 08:23.140
Again, Tsubasa with the interception!

08:23.140 --> 08:24.560
Ishizaki!

08:25.980 --> 08:26.860
Yeah!

08:27.820 --> 08:30.940
Tsubasa's long pass to Ishizaki finds its mark!

08:31.280 --> 08:34.360
Nankatsu has stuck to this counter-attacking pattern all game!

08:34.360 --> 08:37.160
Can they make use of this chance?

08:37.950 --> 08:41.620
Wait! The keeper, Wakabayashi is running towards the ball!

08:41.620 --> 08:42.540
Captain!

08:42.540 --> 08:43.660
What?!

08:43.660 --> 08:47.250
Wakabayashi with a decisive sliding tackle!

08:47.250 --> 08:48.420
Ishizaki!

08:49.800 --> 08:50.760
Tsubasa!

08:50.760 --> 08:53.420
Wakabayashi gets on his feet and

08:53.420 --> 08:55.470
sends a long kick to the other side!

08:56.340 --> 08:57.850
But this ball,

08:59.760 --> 09:03.350
winds up going straight to Tsubasa.

09:04.980 --> 09:08.270
It's a rare missed pass from Wakabayashi!

09:08.690 --> 09:11.030
Tsubasa, come and attack!

09:16.360 --> 09:19.990
This is a challenge from Wakabayashi-kun!

09:22.040 --> 09:23.830
We're in stoppage time now.

09:24.580 --> 09:25.370
All right!

09:31.420 --> 09:33.090
He's dribbling!

09:33.090 --> 09:35.720
Tsubasa, who was defending up until now,

09:35.720 --> 09:37.840
suddenly runs towards the opposing goal!

09:38.970 --> 09:40.720
Tsubasa, the plan!

09:41.930 --> 09:46.350
Isn't it impossible to ask Tsubasa to just defend?

09:46.350 --> 09:48.350
C-Captain!

09:48.350 --> 09:51.440
Tsubasa's football is not about defense,

09:51.440 --> 09:53.900
it's about scoring!

09:54.610 --> 09:56.490
Good job, that's the way!

09:56.950 --> 10:00.450
Go! Tsubasa!

10:00.450 --> 10:02.450
Oh, dad!

10:02.450 --> 10:05.540
You bastard, you dare to look away at a time like this!

10:07.870 --> 10:09.170
What?

10:11.170 --> 10:13.380
Awesome, Tsubasa is heading in alone,

10:13.380 --> 10:15.300
with nobody to stop him!

10:15.300 --> 10:16.050
All right!

10:16.050 --> 10:17.930
That Tsubasa! If that's how it is,

10:17.930 --> 10:20.550
then offense will become our defense!

10:20.550 --> 10:22.180
Let's go all out on this bet!

10:22.180 --> 10:24.720
That's right! This match is supposed to be

10:24.720 --> 10:27.440
a contest between Wakabayashi and Tsubasa.

10:27.440 --> 10:29.600
That's how it should be!

10:29.600 --> 10:32.360
Go! Tsubasa!

10:33.860 --> 10:35.860
Here I come, Wakabayashi!

10:36.280 --> 10:38.070
Come at me, Tsubasa!

10:41.070 --> 10:43.030
Tsubasa fires a mid-range shot!

10:43.030 --> 10:45.200
This course is...

10:46.370 --> 10:48.410
Wakabayashi deflects it!

10:51.330 --> 10:54.050
That was a nice shot and an equally nice save!

10:54.050 --> 10:56.420
What a first clash between them!

10:56.420 --> 10:58.470
Awesome! If you're right-handed,

10:58.470 --> 11:00.760
it's supposed to be sure-fire.

11:00.760 --> 11:03.390
Damn it, I couldn't catch it!

11:03.800 --> 11:07.770
Wakabayashi's awesome, being able to deflect that...

11:07.770 --> 11:10.060
But to be able to make that shot,

11:10.060 --> 11:14.150
you must be a striker, Tsubasa.

11:17.440 --> 11:20.320
It's time for Nankatsu's corner kick

11:20.320 --> 11:22.660
and Tsubasa is the kicker!

11:22.660 --> 11:24.780
Tsubasa in the corner?

11:24.780 --> 11:26.330
Where will he aim?

11:32.120 --> 11:33.420
Listen, Tsubasa.

11:34.710 --> 11:39.300
Aim a little outwards from the center of the ball with an in-front kick,

11:39.720 --> 11:41.260
and swing as if you are grazing the ball!

11:42.220 --> 11:44.140
He takes the corner!

11:44.140 --> 11:45.550
I got it!

11:45.550 --> 11:47.260
It's a cross to Ishizaki!

11:51.730 --> 11:54.270
Wow, it curved!

11:54.270 --> 11:57.530
Tsubasa has used a curve to aim the goal directly!

11:58.030 --> 12:01.860
Wakabayshi grazes the ball with his fingers!

12:01.860 --> 12:02.780
All right!

12:02.780 --> 12:04.410
It's past him!

12:04.410 --> 12:06.780
Wakabayashi can't reach it...!

12:07.120 --> 12:09.910
The ball hits the post!

12:15.080 --> 12:16.670
And here, the whistle marks the end of the first half!

12:16.670 --> 12:19.050
It was a real close one,

12:19.050 --> 12:23.510
with a direct corner kick to goal by Tsubasa!

12:23.510 --> 12:26.720
We're still in a scoreless tie, 0-0.

12:26.720 --> 12:29.520
It was a very nice first half!

12:29.520 --> 12:31.730
What an amazing curve!

12:31.730 --> 12:34.270
Even with my skill, I wonder if I could ever do that.

12:34.900 --> 12:36.650
That Tsubasa!

12:36.650 --> 12:40.740
It's just like him to use a move he just learned at a decisive moment like that...

12:44.280 --> 12:45.660
Dad!

12:50.330 --> 12:51.790
Captain...

12:52.870 --> 12:55.330
It went right past me!

13:05.630 --> 13:06.890
How about it, Tsubasa?

13:06.890 --> 13:08.260
Are you surprised?

13:08.260 --> 13:09.390
Yeah!

13:09.390 --> 13:13.890
You never told us about when you'd be back, Dad.

13:13.890 --> 13:17.520
So, Tsubasa's father is back...

13:17.520 --> 13:21.070
Everyone, thank you for taking care of Tsubasa.

13:21.070 --> 13:22.780
Not a problem!

13:22.780 --> 13:23.860
What are you all acting so proud of?

13:25.320 --> 13:27.820
Guys, you did well in the first half.

13:27.820 --> 13:29.120
Yes.

13:29.120 --> 13:31.290
It was a close call, Tsubasa.

13:31.290 --> 13:33.580
You were so close to scoring!

13:33.580 --> 13:35.290
Well, we can't be too greedy.

13:35.290 --> 13:37.790
But still, it's the first time that we were able to

13:37.790 --> 13:40.340
prevent Shuutetsu from scoring any goals in the first half.

13:40.340 --> 13:42.420
Yeah, you're right!

13:42.420 --> 13:46.430
However, someone's been ignoring our plan.

13:46.430 --> 13:47.590
It's Tsubasa, right?

13:48.800 --> 13:52.430
Hey, I've ignored my coach's plans in the past, too!

13:52.430 --> 13:53.180
What?

13:53.180 --> 13:57.650
And, sometimes, it worked out better than the coach expected!

13:57.650 --> 13:59.520
Like what happened with Tsubasa's case this time.

14:01.070 --> 14:02.230
Everyone!

14:02.230 --> 14:05.740
Football is a sport where you play based on your own judgement.

14:05.740 --> 14:08.570
I also want you to value your own judgement from now on.

14:08.570 --> 14:09.450
That's right.

14:09.450 --> 14:12.830
If you only do as you're told,

14:12.830 --> 14:14.660
your skills won't ever improve.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.080
Yeah.

14:16.080 --> 14:18.460
Remember how we structure our attacks!

14:18.460 --> 14:20.040
Use both wings,

14:20.040 --> 14:21.710
stretch their defense line,

14:21.710 --> 14:23.630
and then create an opening up in the middle.

14:24.880 --> 14:28.380
It's true, Nankatsu is different from what they used to be.

14:28.380 --> 14:29.760
But, when it comes to ball possesion,

14:29.760 --> 14:31.720
we are overwhelmingly superior.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.560
Don't let your guard down in the second half.

14:33.560 --> 14:35.180
Yes!

14:35.180 --> 14:39.150
Everyone, please...

14:39.150 --> 14:41.860
Just one goal, score just one goal.

14:41.860 --> 14:43.190
Captain...

14:44.030 --> 14:47.610
I won't say anything preposterous anymore, like 50 goals.

14:48.280 --> 14:51.160
I'm begging you. Just one goal.

14:53.780 --> 14:54.910
How's that?

14:54.910 --> 14:58.960
Just like I said, Shuutetsu's having a hard time, aren't they?

14:58.960 --> 15:01.540
Depending on how the second half starts,

15:01.540 --> 15:04.630
Shuutetsu might actually lose this match.

15:05.380 --> 15:06.670
Got it?

15:06.670 --> 15:08.170
If you see a chance in the second half,

15:08.170 --> 15:09.760
just go at it with all you've got.

15:09.760 --> 15:10.550
All right!

15:10.550 --> 15:12.260
Go get 'em!

15:13.510 --> 15:14.680
Tsubasa!

15:15.430 --> 15:16.520
Listen to me.

15:16.520 --> 15:18.810
If you're doing this, don't ever lose.

15:18.810 --> 15:20.940
Your Dad hates losers!

15:20.940 --> 15:22.310
Yes.

15:24.320 --> 15:27.860
Well, halftime is over and the players are back on the field.

15:27.860 --> 15:29.700
The second 20 minutes starts now.

15:29.700 --> 15:31.200
Fight, Shuutetsu!

15:31.410 --> 15:33.370
Fight, Shuutetsu!

15:33.570 --> 15:36.870
Win, Shuutetsu!

15:36.870 --> 15:39.250
All right!

15:39.250 --> 15:42.290
Let's get this second half!

15:42.290 --> 15:44.840
Tch, they're just trying to be cool.

15:44.840 --> 15:48.090
Fight, Shuutetsu! Let's go Shuutetsu!

15:48.090 --> 15:51.380
Keep going like this Nankatsu!

15:51.380 --> 15:52.680
The teams have changed sides.

15:52.680 --> 15:55.510
The second half begins with Nankatsu's kick-off!

16:04.400 --> 16:05.440
What?

16:05.440 --> 16:07.270
An unexpected two-man tackle!

16:08.480 --> 16:11.360
Shuutetsu recovers the ball high.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.860
Shuutetsu's mood has changed.

16:14.780 --> 16:16.370
Our Captain...

16:16.370 --> 16:19.500
This is the first time he's asked us for anything.

16:19.500 --> 16:22.330
Whatever it takes, we'll score a goal!

16:22.330 --> 16:24.170
Fall back, guys!

16:24.170 --> 16:27.090
Shuutetsu's attack comes crashing like a surging wave!

16:27.090 --> 16:29.170
Nankatsu's defensive line is being pulled back.

16:37.810 --> 16:40.180
Taki centers!

16:40.180 --> 16:41.980
Kisugi has the ball!

16:41.980 --> 16:44.730
This is Shuutetsu's famous combination play!

16:44.730 --> 16:46.810
Like I'd let you!

16:46.810 --> 16:50.320
Nankatsu's defense is in a panic, and blocking Kisugi by getting physical!

16:52.610 --> 16:54.530
Nankatsu is in danger!

16:54.530 --> 16:56.740
There's a fray in front of the goal!

16:57.450 --> 16:58.490
Izawa!

17:00.200 --> 17:01.450
Out!

17:01.450 --> 17:02.290
Kick it out!

17:05.420 --> 17:08.500
Nankatsu just barely manage to kick the ball away,

17:08.500 --> 17:10.710
and get themselves out of a sticky situation.

17:13.970 --> 17:15.050
Damn it...

17:15.890 --> 17:19.010
These guys are really fired up.

17:19.010 --> 17:23.350
This throw-in spot is perfect for Shuutetsu.

17:23.350 --> 17:24.350
Takasugi!

17:25.100 --> 17:26.190
We're leaving it to you!

17:26.190 --> 17:27.480
All right, leave it to me!

17:27.480 --> 17:29.900
Is Takasugi doing the throw-in?

17:29.900 --> 17:31.070
Oh?

17:31.070 --> 17:35.700
Shuutetsu's center-back Takasugi has come all the way up for this throw-in.

17:35.700 --> 17:38.030
Isn't he a defender?

17:38.030 --> 17:39.450
What is he up to?

17:44.210 --> 17:45.250
Here goes!

17:50.750 --> 17:52.550
Takasugi lets loose with a sharp, long throw!

17:52.550 --> 17:53.960
That's awesome!

17:53.960 --> 17:56.630
The ball is headed straight for Izawa right in front of the goal!

17:56.630 --> 17:57.720
Tsubasa, I'm counting on you!

17:57.720 --> 17:58.720
All right!

18:00.100 --> 18:01.390
I won't lose to you!

18:01.390 --> 18:07.560
I can jump higher than anyone at Shuutetsu!

18:07.560 --> 18:11.570
Izawa and Tsubasa clash in a mid-air battle!

18:11.570 --> 18:12.650
It's a draw!

18:12.650 --> 18:14.570
The ball gets away!

18:16.070 --> 18:19.070
Nankatsu's Okawa recovers the ball!

18:19.070 --> 18:20.160
That's it!

18:20.160 --> 18:22.410
Wait, Shuutetsu's Kisugi cuts it!

18:22.410 --> 18:24.500
He's getting ready to shoot!

18:24.500 --> 18:27.000
Tsubasa is still recovering from the collision!

18:27.000 --> 18:28.790
I've got this!

18:31.420 --> 18:32.840
It's in!

18:32.840 --> 18:36.630
Kisugi's brilliant shot is smashed into the left corner of the goal!

18:37.760 --> 18:39.140
I did it!

18:39.720 --> 18:42.930
Shuutetsu scores first! Shuutetsu!

18:42.930 --> 18:43.930
All right!

18:43.930 --> 18:45.430
Did you see that, Nankatsu?

18:45.430 --> 18:48.190
This is Shuutetsu's true strength.

18:48.190 --> 18:50.020
With this one goal, this game is over.

18:50.020 --> 18:52.360
You did well enough... for Nankatsu.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.570
Exactly.

18:54.860 --> 18:56.650
Not yet!

18:56.650 --> 19:00.030
Don't get ahead of yourselves. The real match starts now.

19:00.030 --> 19:02.320
This is where it really begins, Shuutetsu.

19:02.320 --> 19:03.410
What?

19:03.410 --> 19:05.870
Yeah, it's exactly as Tsubasa says.

19:05.870 --> 19:07.330
We're just getting started!

19:09.170 --> 19:11.830
Tsubasa, guys, you are making a good face.

19:12.540 --> 19:15.090
With that spirit, smash down Shuutetsu.

19:15.090 --> 19:17.840
The real game starts now.

19:19.300 --> 19:22.010
I'm grateful to you all.

19:22.010 --> 19:25.220
I'll protect this lead without fail.

19:25.220 --> 19:26.930
What's up with that?

19:26.930 --> 19:29.690
Is it even in the rules to throw the ball so far?

19:29.690 --> 19:31.480
Unfortunately, it is...

19:31.480 --> 19:33.730
As expected of Shuutetsu Elementary.

19:36.440 --> 19:39.070
The ability to work as a team and individual skill...

19:39.070 --> 19:42.070
Are these the strengths of a national champion?

19:43.030 --> 19:45.990
Since Nankatsu wrapped things up nicely in the first half,

19:45.990 --> 19:48.580
this goal is a harsh blow for them.

19:48.580 --> 19:51.210
And to score just as the second half starts...

19:51.210 --> 19:54.000
How will you get back on your feet, Nankatsu?

19:55.960 --> 19:57.710
Oh, what's this?

19:57.710 --> 20:01.010
It appears that Nankatsu is going for a position change.

20:01.630 --> 20:03.390
Tsubasa, who was the center-back,

20:03.390 --> 20:04.760
has switched to a forward position!

20:04.760 --> 20:08.270
So, you've finally come to face me, Tsubasa?

20:08.270 --> 20:09.930
Let's go, Tsubasa!

20:09.930 --> 20:10.640
Okay!

20:11.390 --> 20:13.400
If they take from you, you steal it back.

20:13.400 --> 20:16.480
That's the iron rule when it comes to a challenge, Tsubasa.

20:17.900 --> 20:20.320
The match resumes.

20:20.320 --> 20:22.570
With the kick-off, Tsubasa immediately breaks forward,

20:22.570 --> 20:24.570
dribbling into Shuutetsu's side.

20:24.570 --> 20:25.490
All right, guys!

20:25.490 --> 20:27.330
Follow Tsubasa's lead!

20:28.290 --> 20:29.370
Stop him!

20:29.370 --> 20:31.500
Just don't let him attack!

20:38.300 --> 20:39.170
What?

20:39.170 --> 20:40.340
That's great!

20:40.340 --> 20:41.920
Tsubasa!

20:41.920 --> 20:44.300
Tsubasa keeps the ball

20:44.300 --> 20:46.390
and advances into Shuutetsu's territory by himself!

20:46.390 --> 20:47.560
Takasugi, stop him!

20:47.560 --> 20:48.890
He's going to shoot!

20:48.890 --> 20:49.850
It doesn't matter!

20:49.850 --> 20:50.680
Let him shoot from there!

20:53.770 --> 20:54.850
Come!

20:54.850 --> 20:55.690
All right!

20:56.360 --> 20:59.070
Tsubasa shoots directly in front of the goal.

20:59.070 --> 21:01.280
So, you chose this course after all!

21:02.490 --> 21:04.700
Nice catch, Wakabayashi!

21:04.700 --> 21:06.070
He jumped sideways and saved it!

21:06.870 --> 21:07.870
Great!

21:07.870 --> 21:09.080
You stopped it at that course...

21:09.080 --> 21:11.370
You might've had some chances in the first half,

21:11.370 --> 21:14.080
but if I can just stop this course, then it won't get by me.

21:14.080 --> 21:16.960
Everyone, advance while Tsubasa's still here!

21:16.960 --> 21:18.130
Let's stretch that lead!

21:19.130 --> 21:20.000
All right!

21:20.000 --> 21:21.380
Oh, crap!

21:21.380 --> 21:22.760
Everyone! Fall back!

21:23.380 --> 21:24.590
The roles are reversed!

21:24.590 --> 21:26.760
This time, it's Shuutetsu's counter-attack!

21:26.760 --> 21:28.510
Like I'd let you pass!

21:29.640 --> 21:30.600
You're in my way!

21:30.600 --> 21:32.180
I won't lose to you!

21:32.930 --> 21:36.020
Even though we crushed them in the previous match...

21:36.690 --> 21:37.190
Taki!

21:38.360 --> 21:39.360
Okay!

21:39.360 --> 21:40.570
All right, let's go for the second goal!

21:41.360 --> 21:42.570
What?!

21:42.570 --> 21:45.200
Tsubasa steals the ball back from Taki.

21:45.200 --> 21:46.910
When did he come back?

21:46.910 --> 21:50.160
Go, Tsubasa!

21:50.160 --> 21:51.660
He's so fast.

21:52.330 --> 21:55.540
His speed is something, but more importantly, his ability to change between attack and defense is what's most impressive.

21:58.670 --> 21:59.500
He's going to shoot!

21:59.500 --> 22:00.670
Shoot!

22:00.670 --> 22:01.380
What?

22:01.380 --> 22:05.050
He's still on Nankatsu's side, you know...

22:06.130 --> 22:08.220
Can this be...

22:08.220 --> 22:12.060
Tsubasa takes an extra long shot from Nankatsu's own side!

22:13.060 --> 22:16.560
Will this become the goal that ties the match?!

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.630 --> 22:50.640
<i>suguremono zo to machijÃ» sawagu</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.640
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.640 --> 22:56.640
<i>chÃ´-chÃ´ samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.640 --> 22:56.640
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:01.650
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:01.650
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.020 --> 23:08.030
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.020 --> 23:08.030
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.240 --> 23:14.950
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.240 --> 23:14.950
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.240 --> 23:21.000
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.290 --> 23:26.010
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.290 --> 23:26.010
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.180
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.180
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.180 --> 23:39.060
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.350 --> 23:46.030
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.350 --> 23:46.030
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

